{"availability":"available","full":"ZJU-REAL/Polaris","name":"Polaris","description":"Toward Autonomous Scientific Discovery","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":252,"forks":36,"created":"2026-07-22T18:28:44Z","updated":"2026-10-09T21:15:03Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://zju-real.github.io/Polaris/","topics":["ai-agents","ai-scientist","auto-research","dsh-plugin","polaris-agent"],"demo":"http://101.37.174.109:8080/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.486Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.486Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.486Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.486Z","stars":252,"forks":36}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Autonomous, end-to-end AI research: from literature to a reviewed paper.","Powered by a long-running agent core that plans, executes, and self-verifies its own work, turning every task into a resumable, auditable, human-gated run.","Polaris runs the entire research lifecycle in one desktop app: literature survey, idea generation, idea review, experiment building on real GPU servers, LaTeX paper writing, and paper review. It is built for one researcher on their own computer — everything runs locally, with no server to set up — and it treats every long task as a Voyage: a persisted, resumable, human-gated agent run that can span hours or days without losing state."],"features":["Research Wiki, \"compile, don't retrieve.\" LLMs read papers and compile a persistent, cross-linked","knowledge base up front, instead of doing on-demand RAG at query time. One wiki per paper, shared platform-wide. Research digests, and Obsidian vault sync with [[wikilinks]] and frontmatter.","One content pool, four collections. Every paper is stored exactly once; direction libraries,","topic shelves, personal libraries, and the daily feed are membership layers over that pool. Libraries are decoupled from topics (many-to-many), own their own inclusion config, and come with governance: curators, monthly…","Daily arXiv feed. A feed of each day's new papers, with likes and one-click collection"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"0456ecced09bc2479c323d1516aade3497ff7a86fa507caa8fe6665b823612df","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.566Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.566Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Autonomous, end-to-end AI research: from literature to a reviewed paper.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"Polaris runs the entire research lifecycle in one desktop app: literature survey, idea generation, idea review, experiment building on real GPU servers, LaTeX paper writing, and paper review. It is built for one researcher on their own computer — everything runs locally, with no server to set up — and it treats every long task as a Voyage: a persisted, resumable, human-gated…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"A guest account on an older, frozen web instance, for looking around (new releases are desktop-only): sign in at with the username guest and the password zjuguest123.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"The app runs everything on your computer: it ships its own Python engine and sets it up on first launch (SQLite, no Docker, no login, no server address).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"The easiest way is an agent you already use: install and sign in to Claude Code, Codex, or Gemini CLI on the same computer, add it under Agent backends, and it answers every model call with no API key — see Agent backends.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"0456ecced09bc2479c323d1516aade3497ff7a86fa507caa8fe6665b823612df","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.567Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-09T21:15:03Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ZJU-REAL/Polaris/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:53.568Z","hash":"0456ecced09bc2479c323d1516aade3497ff7a86fa507caa8fe6665b823612df","originalBytes":19978,"storedBytes":19978,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agent","docs","model","voyage","paper","one","app","experiment","run","every","idea","research","engine","make","runs","code","over","review","task","agents","desktop","polaris","real","tool","wiki","calls","each","full","local","models","see","server","shell","under","against","citation","claude","first","frontend","install","libraries","library","live","loop","rather","backends","codex","core","deterministic","gpu","latex","literature","main","mcp","only","own","papers","single","skills","through","api","arxiv","budget","compile","computer","debate","dependencies","drafting","feed","gate","instead","lab","layer","license","llm","macos","metrics","navigator","once","per","plan","project","read-only","same","ssh","stage","state","sync","web","windows","work","abstraction","acp","agents.md","apis","architecture.md","backend","bash","build","call","check","checks","citations","cli","collaborative","concept","config","context","crdt","daily","data","desktop.md","development.md","documentation","electron","elo","english","external","figures","gemini","give","helm","ideas","in-process","installer","keeps","knowledge","linux","logs","loop.","map","metric","needs","never","new","package","page","parsing","persistent","platform","plus","queue","releases","remote","resumable","review.","reviewer","rubric","scheduler","scoring","semantic","servers","services","sextant","shared","sqlite","src","sse","start","stays","step","steps","table",